; kilim.storage.browser: the driver of kilim.storage on the Web Storage API of
; the browser, with Brr_io.Storage. main.ml calls
; Kilim_storage_browser.install (). It uses none of Printf, Format, Scanf,
; Str, Hashtbl, Random, Fun or Printexc (test/link). windtrap runs only native
; code, thus test/dom/guards.txt lists the guards of this library with their
; tests.

(library
 (name kilim_storage_browser)
 (public_name kilim.storage.browser)
 (flags
  (:standard -w +50))
 (libraries kilim kilim.storage brr))
